s so in the response. How fast are live basketball scores? The REST scores endpoint refreshes on a 15-second cache during live games (~200ms typical round trip). WebSocket push is on the Pro plan. Leagues in this sport Every league we serve for this sport, each with its own endpoints and coverage. NBA API — Live Scores, Box Scores & Props WNBA API NCAA Basketball API Also on this sport NBA Player Props API NBA Shot Chart API Stats reference NBA Player Stats API NBA Player Props API Odds & two-source verification Build guides How to build a fantasy basketball app How to build a WNBA live scoreboard How to build a WNBA quarter tracker How to build a WNBA odds board How to build a WNBA schedule browser How to build a WNBA team-form tool How to build an NCAAB scoreboard How to build a March Madness archive How to build an NCAAB game-detail view How to build an NCAAB team-form dashboard How to build an NCAAB head-to-head tool Get an API key in 30 seconds Get API key, free Read the quickstart The sports data API built for ballers. Add to Google preferred sources Sports & Leagues Soccer Football Premier League La Liga Serie A Bundesliga Ligue 1 Champions League MLS World Cup 2026 Africa Cup of Nations CONCACAF Gold Cup Copa América Euro Championship UEFA Nations League Basketball NBA NCAA Basketball WNBA American Football NFL NCAAF (FBS & FCS) Baseball MLB Ice Hockey NHL Cricket MMA UFC Boxing Formula 1 Product Docs API Reference Pricing Coverage API Status Sports coverage League codes What&#x27;s new Blog About Datasets Injuries Live NBA Props Live NHL Props Live NBA Shot Chart MLB Odds MLB Pitch Data Free Sports API Tools Odds Calculator Parlay Calculator No-Vig Calculator Hedge Calculator Kelly Criterion Calculator Tutorials Fantasy hockey app Fantasy basketball app Soccer xG app Cricket app NFL fantasy football API tutorial NFL scouting tool NFL conditions analytics tool NFL betting model API tutorial NFL live game center API tutorial NCAAF scoreboard and live game cen